<title>HONG KONG: Amoy Prop trends above placement price.</title>
<headline>Amoy Prop trends above placement price.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Amoy Properties Ltd led the most active list of Hong Kong stocks in Wednesday morning trade, managing to trade just above its placement price, brokers said.</p>
<p>The share was trading at HK$11.15, down HK$0.35 from Tuesday's close of HK$11.50 and intraday high of HK$11.90.</p>
<p>A total of 317.12 million shares worth HK$3.52 billion were traded in late morning.</p>
<p>The company made a placement of 310 million new shares at HK$11.10 each on Tuesday. The placement raised a net HK$3.39 billion which management said would be used to reduce debt.</p>
